{"version":0.2,"sceneDisplayName":"Monster ~ Phuture Noize~Kapsyloffer","songDisplayName":"Monster","songLocation":"Assets/Monster.ogg","songLength":184.0,"description":"The year is 2085, man has conquered Mars. While there you stole a priceless relic (worth 10B spacebucks) from Arkhan's mine on Mars, a remenant from an Ancient Martian civilization. However this relic was cursed. By stealing it you've ensured the destruction of humanity as we know it. The survivors of the apocalypse have sent robots back in time to prevent Arkhan's wrath and to ensure a brigther future for humanity. ","songArtist":"Phuture Noize","mapper":"Kapsyloffer","tempo":153.0,"previewTime":40.0,"maps":["Hard"],"obstacleSet":"Normal","materialPropertiesSet":"Cave_AP2","enemySet":"Robots","moveSpeed":3.0,"timingWindowSize":100.0,"customMainMenuColor":{"Main":{"a":0.31764707,"r":0.311320782,"g":0.115148887,"b":0.04552332},"Fog":{"a":0.333333343,"r":0.5377358,"g":0.343553454,"b":0.0},"Glow":{"a":0.219607845,"r":0.3584906,"g":0.2062114,"b":0.0},"Enemy":{"a":1.0,"r":0.0,"g":0.0,"b":0.0}}}